    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/871af3fe0b6ec81ffcc22b1608afffa0.avif?t=1714038575\" width=616 height=76 /></span><br><br>Princess Parent is a modern version of classic life simulation games where you play the parent of a young girl.<br><br>Schedule her time! With timeless parenting gameplay, you will guide your daughter's upbringing, choose which activities, lessons and jobs your daughter will do each monthly cycle.<br><br>Starting from the serene heartland of Masan, your daughter's life will reveal a tapestry of new destinations and kindred spirits, weaving a rich narrative of growth and exploration. <br><br>Will you journey to the fabled mining realms of Eryx, or perhaps venture to the forlorn expanses near Zuhril, where the earth lies cloaked in ash, and rumors speak of ancient dragons that may yet dwell there ...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/fe2991d673a2ff20bd40831df4a82fd2.avif?t=1714038575\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/a2461d645a4df5a1fbd5fd270accd2c8.avif?t=1714038575\" width=617 height=76 /></span><br><br>Explore a range of classes for your daughter to learn within a tech tree, with each one unlocking new events and a range of possible endings.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/46d55f8d396506be846403cdda960d42.poster.avif?t=1714038575\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/46d55f8d396506be846403cdda960d42.webm?t=1714038575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/46d55f8d396506be846403cdda960d42.mp4?t=1714038575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/1f36b31bbf39b116f1d2f8921fdea32b.avif?t=1714038575\" width=616 height=76 /></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in a narrative that unfolds day by day.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/9761922102cbadedb318f04119604a13.poster.avif?t=1714038575\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/9761922102cbadedb318f04119604a13.webm?t=1714038575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/9761922102cbadedb318f04119604a13.mp4?t=1714038575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/112ba2f1d25cb05e8703225c307e7078.avif?t=1714038575\" width=616 height=76 /></span><br><br>Embark on a narrative adventure where the choices you make offer a myriad of endings, each offering a distinct and captivating resolution to your daughter's journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2629420/extras/18bbc111a8f30ce64bf95c9cff35f62f.avif?t=1714038575\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Princess Parent, a new parent simulation game produced by a small, passionate team based in London in the UK.",
